---
source: tests/cli_help_snapshot_tests.rs
description: gpy theme import
expression: help
---
Import a `starship.toml` into a GPY palette + prompt theme

Usage: gpy theme import [OPTIONS] <PATH>

Arguments:
  <PATH>  Path to the source `starship.toml`

Options:
      --name <NAME>   Base name for the emitted artifacts (default: file stem)
      --force         Overwrite existing artifacts of the same name, or shadow a builtin or plugin theme or palette
      --stdout        Print both artifacts instead of writing files
      --apply-layout  Also write the derived `enabled_segments` into the active config
  -h, --help          Print help
